    "body": "fix on issue/2568-gate-heavy-diff · PR #2779 · pinned by `a_motion_source_change_reaches_the_motion_and_app_heavy_lanes`, `a_changed_suite_reaches_only_its_own_heavy_binary`, `reach_follows_the_crate_dependencies`, `gate_heavy_is_a_tier_with_a_base` (and five more in `xtask/src/heavy_plan_tests.rs`) · merges when reviewed\n\nNote: the PR does not change `pr-test.yml`. A workflow change needs the maintainer, and that workflow refuses a PR that changes `xtask/`. The PR body and `docs/decisions/2568-gate-heavy-diff.md` say this. The maintainer decides if that part needs a new issue.\n",
